[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Expensive and Uncomfortable]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.39]What did the man in this story do? | 故事中的那个人做了什么？
[00:16.15]When a plane from London arrived at Sydney airport, | 当一架来自伦敦的飞机抵达悉尼机场时，
[00:20.66]workers began to unload a number of wooden boxes which contained clothing. | 工人们开始卸下装有服装的一批木箱。
[00:27.95]No one could account for the fact that one of the boxes was extremely heavy. | 其中有只箱子特别重，可谁也弄不清是怎么回事。
[00:35.42]It suddenly occurred to one of the workers to open up the box. | 突然一个工人想到打开箱子看看。
[00:41.62]He was astonished at what he found. | 看到的情景使他惊呆了，
[00:45.57]A man was lying in the box on top of a pile of woollen goods. | 箱内有一个人正躺在一堆毛料制品上。
[00:52.41]He was so surprised at being discovered that he did not even try to run away. | 他被人发现后感到非常吃惊，甚至都没有企图逃跑。
[01:00.85]After he was arrested, | 被捕后，
[01:03.10]the man admitted hiding in the box before the plane left London. | 这个人承认在飞机离开伦敦前他就藏在了箱子里。
[01:10.06]He had had a long and uncomfortable trip, | 他经历了漫长而又难受的旅程，
[01:14.62]for he had been confined to the wooden box for over eighteen hours. | 因为他在木箱里闷了18个多小时。
[01:21.89]The man was ordered to pay ￡3, 500 for the cost of the trip. | 这个人被责令支付3,500英镑的旅费。
[01:29.89]The normal price of a ticket is ￡2, 000! | 而正常票价是2,000英镑！
